    <!-- Dice set requirements (help sheet) -->
    <string name="dice_help_intro">A dice set changes how the dice look. Every part is optional: anything missing keeps the default look.</string>
    <string name="dice_help_ways_title">Two ways to add a set</string>
    <string name="dice_help_ways_text">• Upload a whole pack as a ZIP (Upload ZIP).\n• Create a set (New set), then pick a die and upload an image for it.</string>
    <string name="dice_help_2d_title">2D images</string>
    <string name="dice_help_2d_text">• PNG or WebP with a transparent background, 512×512 px (larger images are scaled down).\n• The die silhouette fills the canvas, centred.\n• Leave the middle empty: the app writes the die name or the rolled number on top.\n• Shown at about 56 dp, so keep details bold.\n• d100 is a pair of d10s; leave space under them for the caption.</string>
    <string name="dice_help_3d_title">3D face textures</string>
    <string name="dice_help_3d_text">• Square PNG or WebP, 512×512 px.\n• Painted on every face of that die, under the number. The top of the image is the face’s top.\n• Keep the centre calm so numbers stay readable.\n• Not used for custom dN dice (they are spheres).</string>
    <string name="dice_help_zip_title">ZIP pack</string>
    <string name="dice_help_zip_text">Name files after the dice: d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20, d100, dN. A manifest.json is optional; add one to set the name and colours. For dark dice, set a light number colour (\"text\"), otherwise numbers follow the theme and may be hard to read.</string>
    <string name="dice_help_zip_tree" translatable="false">my_dice.zip\n├── manifest.json     (optional)\n├── 2d/\n│   ├── d6.png\n│   └── d20.png\n├── 3d/\n│   └── d6_face.png\n└── fonts/\n    └── numbers.ttf   (optional)</string>
    <string name="dice_help_manifest_example" translatable="false">{\n  "formatVersion": 1,\n  "id": "wood",\n  "name": "Wood",\n  "style": { "fill": "#8D6E63", "edge": "#3E2723", "text": "#FFF8E1" },\n  "dice": { "d6": { "image2d": "2d/d6.png", "pips": true } }\n}</string>
    <string name="dice_help_limits_title">Limits</string>
    <string name="dice_help_limits_text">Images up to 10 MB each, fonts (TTF, OTF) up to 5 MB, the whole ZIP up to 50 MB unpacked and 300 files. Other files are skipped.</string>
