    <string name="help_pool_list_title">Your pools</string>
    <string name="help_pool_list_text">A pool is a named list of items to pick from. Tap a pool to pick from it (an empty pool opens the editor); tap the pencil to edit it.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_new_title">New pool</string>
    <string name="help_pool_new_text">Tap + to make a pool. Give it a name, then add items one by one or import a CSV or ZIP.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_delete_title">Delete</string>
    <string name="help_pool_delete_text">Long-press a pool to delete it, with its items and images. You’ll be asked to confirm.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_items_title">Items</string>
    <string name="help_pool_items_text">Add item opens the editor: a name (unique in the pool), an optional image and an optional colour. Tap an item to change or delete it; the arrows reorder it. Nothing is saved until you tap Save.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_names_title">Show names</string>
    <string name="help_pool_names_text">When every item has an image you can hide the names and show the images alone. While some items have no image, names are always shown.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_display_title">How items look</string>
    <string name="help_pool_display_text">No images: names only, on the item’s colour. Some images: a thumbnail (or a placeholder) with the name. The colour frames the image and fills the name label.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_import_title">Import</string>
    <string name="help_pool_import_text">The import button reads a CSV (name,image,color) or a ZIP (items.csv + images/). Choose Extend to add the items, or Replace to swap them. Duplicate names get “ #2”, “ #3”…</string>
    <string name="help_pool_export_title">Export</string>
    <string name="help_pool_export_text">The export button saves or shares the pool: a ZIP with images, or a CSV with names and colours. An exported file imports back unchanged.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_pick_title">Pick</string>
    <string name="help_pool_pick_text">Set How many (type, tap the arrows or swipe the field up and down) and tap Pick. The result is decided at once; the dots are only the reveal.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_repeats_title">Allow repeats</string>
    <string name="help_pool_repeats_text">On: the same item can come up more than once, up to 100 picks. Off: every item comes up at most once per pick.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_remove_title">Remove picked items</string>
    <string name="help_pool_remove_text">On: picked items are set aside and not picked again (like drawing names from a hat). Put back all returns them. Nothing is deleted.</string>
    <string name="help_pool_results_title">Results</string>
    <string name="help_pool_results_text">Copy or share the result as text or as a picture. The history button shows recent picks.</string>
</resources>
